From 5affc48db1ea02d9784c802414cf87a37c80ca24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:13:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/16] dwc2d: LAN7800 Ethernet (Raspberry Pi 3B+)

Initializes the Microchip LAN7800 over vendor register requests (lite
reset, MAC address and perfect filter, USB burst settings, FIFOs, PHY
autonegotiation) and runs it as a network adapter with its RX/TX command
headers. Written from the datasheet with FreeBSD's if_muge (BSD-2-Clause)
as reference. Untested on hardware yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
